    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/6ef5c999dd6ca1dc0298c5dd818cb4ce.avif?t=1741316144\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is the Operation: Harsh Doorstop &quot;Development Build&quot; Closed Beta?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Closed Beta &quot;Development Build&quot; is a dedicated version of Operation: Harsh Doorstop that provides exclusive access to the latest *work-in-progress* features, experimental updates, and internal playtests. Updated nightly, this branch is the frontline of development, where our team tests new systems and mechanics before they\u2019re released to the public.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By joining the Closed Beta, you'll gain early access to upcoming content, help shape the future of the game, and participate in organized playtests hosted by our development team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Exclusive early testing of new features.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/6d9f2b5399bb055a2d4759557f52831f.poster.avif?t=1741316144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/6d9f2b5399bb055a2d4759557f52831f.webm?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/6d9f2b5399bb055a2d4759557f52831f.mp4?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Support Development &amp; Play Early</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to the Closed Beta is available in two ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase the <i>Supporter Edition</i> upgrade from the Operation: Harsh Doorstop Steam page, which includes Closed Beta access plus additional supporter rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase Closed Beta access directly from this store page at a discounted price (without the extra Supporter Edition rewards).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All funds from Closed Beta and Supporter Edition sales go directly towards ongoing development and supporting our growing modding community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Get involved and support the future of Operation: Harsh Doorstop.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/0c3c6acbbbebcaa5e865afa0e8e6297e.poster.avif?t=1741316144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/0c3c6acbbbebcaa5e865afa0e8e6297e.webm?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/0c3c6acbbbebcaa5e865afa0e8e6297e.mp4?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Modding &amp; SDK Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Closed Beta also features its own dedicated Steam Workshop and SDK environment. Mod creators can use this to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test mods against upcoming game versions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare content for future public releases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with unreleased features and assets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use advanced debugging tools to identify and fix mod issues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're fine-tuning existing mods or building entirely new experiences, the Closed Beta gives you the tools to stay ahead of the curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Modding with unreleased content and new tools.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/b0f11a11e18eb66a9dfaec39789c49ec.poster.avif?t=1741316144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/b0f11a11e18eb66a9dfaec39789c49ec.webm?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/b0f11a11e18eb66a9dfaec39789c49ec.mp4?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nightly updates with experimental features and content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to exclusive playtests with the development team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dedicated Steam Workshop and SDK for testing mods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced debugging tools for mod creators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support ongoing development and community modding efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early hands-on access to future gameplay systems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step behind the scenes and join us in building the future of tactical gaming. Whether you're a player eager to try the latest updates or a creator refining your next mod, the Operation: Harsh Doorstop Closed Beta is your gateway to the cutting edge.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/6ef5c999dd6ca1dc0298c5dd818cb4ce.avif?t=1741316144\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is the Operation: Harsh Doorstop &quot;Development Build&quot; Closed Beta?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Closed Beta &quot;Development Build&quot; is a dedicated version of Operation: Harsh Doorstop that provides exclusive access to the latest *work-in-progress* features, experimental updates, and internal playtests. Updated nightly, this branch is the frontline of development, where our team tests new systems and mechanics before they\u2019re released to the public.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By joining the Closed Beta, you'll gain early access to upcoming content, help shape the future of the game, and participate in organized playtests hosted by our development team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Exclusive early testing of new features.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/6d9f2b5399bb055a2d4759557f52831f.poster.avif?t=1741316144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/6d9f2b5399bb055a2d4759557f52831f.webm?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/6d9f2b5399bb055a2d4759557f52831f.mp4?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Support Development &amp; Play Early</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to the Closed Beta is available in two ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase the <i>Supporter Edition</i> upgrade from the Operation: Harsh Doorstop Steam page, which includes Closed Beta access plus additional supporter rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase Closed Beta access directly from this store page at a discounted price (without the extra Supporter Edition rewards).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All funds from Closed Beta and Supporter Edition sales go directly towards ongoing development and supporting our growing modding community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Get involved and support the future of Operation: Harsh Doorstop.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/0c3c6acbbbebcaa5e865afa0e8e6297e.poster.avif?t=1741316144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/0c3c6acbbbebcaa5e865afa0e8e6297e.webm?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/0c3c6acbbbebcaa5e865afa0e8e6297e.mp4?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Modding &amp; SDK Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Closed Beta also features its own dedicated Steam Workshop and SDK environment. Mod creators can use this to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test mods against upcoming game versions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare content for future public releases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with unreleased features and assets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use advanced debugging tools to identify and fix mod issues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're fine-tuning existing mods or building entirely new experiences, the Closed Beta gives you the tools to stay ahead of the curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Modding with unreleased content and new tools.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/b0f11a11e18eb66a9dfaec39789c49ec.poster.avif?t=1741316144\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/b0f11a11e18eb66a9dfaec39789c49ec.webm?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1307180/extras/b0f11a11e18eb66a9dfaec39789c49ec.mp4?t=1741316144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nightly updates with experimental features and content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to exclusive playtests with the development team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dedicated Steam Workshop and SDK for testing mods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced debugging tools for mod creators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support ongoing development and community modding efforts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Early hands-on access to future gameplay systems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step behind the scenes and join us in building the future of tactical gaming. Whether you're a player eager to try the latest updates or a creator refining your next mod, the Operation: Harsh Doorstop Closed Beta is your gateway to the cutting edge.</p>",
